- case_events: the CASE EVENTS below happen only in some cases of the process (for example a request or a complaint). The requirement must apply only when they happen: keep each one in the requirement, in plain words, as a part that starts with "If" or "When". For each, give its id and "kept_as": the words of your requirement, copied exactly, that keep it, starting with "If" or "When". Both are checked automatically. Use an empty list if CASE EVENTS is "none".
